                                        "entry_id": "fec1832a-ad0c-3c76-9958-8fa72bfcd03a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fast-growing grass of the Bambusoideae subfamily, characterised by its woody, hollow, round, straight, jointed stem."
