                                                "example_id": "0ccd619f-4701-4892-a613-ab76eec62c58",
                                                "sense_id": "6b52ad06-82c2-346e-b44c-de45cccc2171",
                                                "text": "The craze for bambooing furniture and accessories was one of many popular paint techniques in the 18th century and early Victorian era."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7fae3aa-3cf6-3686-8b33-fec53c2b1206",
                                        "entry_id": "948123b0-10c2-3b99-87be-9219e3b94497",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To penetrate sexually."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "India",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d1eca9a-97f1-43fe-9c1a-850b15618f0b",
                                                "sense_id": "e7fae3aa-3cf6-3686-8b33-fec53c2b1206",
                                                "text": "If you're just a girl from Lucknow, with no fluid cash, you'll be just one more among thousands going from producer to producer by auto-rickshaw, and every photographer who agrees to take a picture for your portfolio will want to introduce you to his bed upstairs in the loft. And what you'll get out of all this in the end is a lot of bambooing and maybe a dance or two in his videos."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83f02ed3-2719-4f82-a0fb-ea3fba6cede2",
                                                "sense_id": "e7fae3aa-3cf6-3686-8b33-fec53c2b1206",
                                                "text": "One scene of attachment and intimacy shows Vijay careening into their shared apartment dead drunk and insulting a praying Ajay for his devotion to the household god, Hanuman […], saying that instead of being rescued Ajay will be \"bamboo-ed,\" a popular slang for anal penetration."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
